+# Roadmap to Level 4 (High Automation)
+
+1) Hardened sandbox & enforced OPA
+ - Deploy pod-executor sandbox (services/sandbox/pod_executor) in isolated namespace; enable gVisor/Kata; create RBAC that only allows approved SA to call sandbox.
+ - Enable Gatekeeper ConstraintTemplate (opa/constrainttemplate_provenance.yaml) and tune in audit mode -> enforce.
+
+2) Production RAG + calibrated verifier
+ - Deploy Milvus (helm/milvus) and the retriever (services/rag/retriever).
+ - Deploy cross-encoder verifier (services/verifier/cross_encoder) on GPU nodes; tune CROSS_ENCODER_MIN_SCORE.
+ - Add monitoring & calibration: collect verifier scores, build calibration mapping to confidence thresholds.
+
+3) Canary rollouts + automated rollback
+ - Use Argo Rollouts (argo/rollout/model-rollout.yaml) for canary + analysis based on Prometheus metrics, integrate with autorollback controller.
+
+4) PREEMPT_RT & HIL sign-off
+ - Build PREEMPT_RT node images, create runtimeClass preempt-rt, schedule RT-critical pods to that class, run rt_benchmark and HIL jobs, require signed evidence before OTA.
+
+5) Strong authn/authz & audit
+ - Use JWKS/OIDC for approver and service tokens, require mTLS for internal services, ensure A2A approval records are KMS-signed and stored in MCP.
